# The image copies `policy.py` and `proxy.py` and nothing else. Keeping the
# rest out of the build context is not only about size: this is the container
# that holds the Docker socket, and the less that is sent to the daemon to
# build it, the less there is to reason about.
conftest.py
test_*.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
